#: b7f67d61e80d4273aa545acd9d46f769 cd18217ac5524f249d84ca3963076bde
#: d0b84fce59084f04bf771e6c39fe9162
msgid "Battery Monitors (aka Power Monitors/Modules)"
msgstr "电池监控器（又称电源监控器/模块）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:9
#: 45291a7761284bc89f8063d310dd6a79 62b28c2aea3a459c8da9814099addc82
#: aafccddc863849efbc31928c688762ae bf6ca37f28a2485d8e53d8e8dfac9ac0
#: d917776a10504f12a2160f2013600eaf
msgid "Power Monitors/Modules provide these benefits:"
msgstr "电源监控器/模块的优势："

#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:11
#: 0b35f0c85324455cb769884a5ab53bf5 6065f0873a9c49da9a002350dea963dc
#: 7caa385e36c148f692eabdc86ba65be9 ca4d806303ba459180e9e88979c60ead
#: ede39952edbd43fb841ecc9a5d5a8b22
msgid ""
"Most provide a stable power supply to the autopilot, in addition to "
"monitoring, and therefore reduces the chance of a brown-out"
msgstr "大多数除监控外还能为飞控提供稳定电源，从而降低欠压断电的风险"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:12
#: 1f7fa171e85d46efac9d77073338f9ea 297734ef01ac429289ff2e42a05e46c8
#: 618c081e82604313a9c3f0b65447dd35 83957219fc4a413f8b5a1c6d2e62777d
#: c0f2a552b0604e8cad24475329fb2079
msgid ""
"Allows real-time monitoring of the battery’s voltage and current and "
"triggering a low battery failsafe"
msgstr "允许实时监控电池电压和电流，并触发低电量失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:13
#: 1c11c5ff54ee427fa8a46b82f6fc890b 608614745b5a4bbbb24adb6361488fd8
#: 6791baa5b5a04875bb5797afb26afc72 7f5983c3ee664724b5c6f1171d82fa06
#: cf401d68756e4246ae98fa343b0c86b6
msgid ""
"Allows compensating for the interference on the compass from the motors "
"using the COMPASS_MOT_x and COMPASS_PMOT_x parameters, see :ref:`common-"
"compass-setup-advanced`."
msgstr ""
"允许使用 COMPASS_MOT_x 和 COMPASS_PMOT_x 参数补偿电机对罗盘的干扰，详见 :ref:`common-compass-"
"setup-advanced`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:15
#: 3868eb457a5a4b8196cbe00a282aee48 72b209cd150747318456adff8f9ac9d7
#: c2525e927cbb4783967e2f3610297989 d49dcffaf5e647519d951776a71fce6e
#: e72cb60cb8be43eda79fc54142ab106b
msgid ""
"The links below have information about the most commonly used power "
"monitors/modules"
msgstr "以下链接包含最常用的电源监控器/模块的信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:17
#: 3c94d0d7ec6b49ffb2492b3f6344100d 600cb7f92c114da2ac145a94a601014a
#: 6eb0971baa67442bb12fff02596fbdb2 c9baaa2e42ee4b048fbdfee0e9e70a06
#: fa4ec5cb1df248f8893bcc4d446cdd83
msgid ""
"Up to 16 batteries/power monitors can be monitored. Each monitor has its own"
" group of configuration parameters, designated by ``BATTx_`` with x denoting"
" each monitor in the system (first monitor \"x\" is null character, ie "
"``BATT_`` prefix). In addition, a ``BATT_MONITOR`` \"type\" = SUM is "
"available, that consolidates  battery monitors into a single report using "
"the :ref:`BATT_SUM_MASK<BATT_SUM_MASK>`."
msgstr ""
"最多可同时监控 16 块电池/电源监控器。每个监控器有其自己的一组配置参数，以 ``BATTx_`` 标识（x "
"表示系统中每个监控器的编号，第一个监控器的 x 为空字符，即使用 ``BATT_`` 前缀）。此外，还提供了 ``BATT_MONITOR`` "
"「类型」= SUM 的选项，可使用 :ref:`BATT_SUM_MASK<BATT_SUM_MASK>` 将多个电池监控器合并为单一报告。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:19
#: 3ff7ab3a6dd74128b1ff3d36feb724b9 6054275b828b43ddb156fdbf006a98a0
#: c78c406b2c6341438588880ddce94683 ddde209ab2a5477cb14744a4fdc64c56
#: edcb3f369c044207a4fe9cf356ca4fe6
msgid ""
"some kinds of monitors can provide bi-directional battery current "
"information. These are useful when generators or MPPT chargers are being "
"utilized in the system to monitor the net charge state of the battery."
msgstr "某些类型的监控器可提供双向电池电流信息。当系统中使用发电机或 MPPT 充电器时，这对于监控电池的净充电状态非常有用。"

