#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:57
#: 3218bcd5a1d54e789e729217ee2d9330 3ef461cdd6f24f10a990de7e34bfb4c3
#: 4e3689560ea24f699ea467daa66b7b82 fb59e237280347ae8130fa4760ff7032
msgid "DroneCAN Battery Tag"
msgstr "DroneCAN 电池标签（Battery Tag）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:59
#: 23b176a24e8c4f7eb0c8bfb92042e3f8 576de764965249debefffe2c3dc0e4f9
#: 5dc995846fe1401faf2f81314d1f25b0 68b6ca3a2ec94f92800e7e5d0e467561
msgid ""
"A DroneCAN based Battery Tag which monitors battery age and user cycles can "
"be easily created by reflashing the `Matek DroneCAN RC adapter board "
"<https://www.mateksys.com/?portfolio=can-l4-rc>`__ using the `Battery Tag "
"AP_Periph firmware "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/latest/MatekL431-BatteryTag/>`__ ."
" Firmware updating process is explained :ref:`HERE <dronecan-firmware-"
"flashing>`."
msgstr ""
"使用 `Battery Tag AP_Periph 固件 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/latest/MatekL431-BatteryTag/>`__ "
"重新刷写 `Matek DroneCAN RC 转接板 "
"<https://www.mateksys.com/?portfolio=can-l4-rc>`__，即可轻松制作一个基于 DroneCAN "
"的电池标签（Battery Tag），用于监测电池使用时长和用户循环次数。固件更新过程参见 :ref:`此处 <dronecan-firmware-"
"flashing>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:61
#: b3fa71758a7f45a1bc8f3ea79129ed3a baa215ece1bd49bca638f89759ac79cd
#: bfa2e7d165ed4d3195664f1a6d3a3bde c43879c7d5314463a0d93ad296ef2e95
msgid ""
"VimDrones also has Battery Tag firmware for use with their DroneCan devices "
"based on the L431, `HERE "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/latest/VM-L431-BatteryTag/>`__."
msgstr ""
"VimDrones 也提供适用于其基于 L431 的 DroneCan 设备的 Battery Tag 固件，见 `此处 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/latest/VM-L431-BatteryTag/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:63
#: 049bf917bdf94e1b97f6f3df021f491f 5f4fe5491fde401da6ee518bd0b342b5
#: e11aafdd581d451581c86814e9e886c1 ef2077186e234d62ade9b5ab6f2822b3
msgid ""
"Battery Tag data can be accessed easily via either examining the tag's "
"DroneCAN parameters using the :ref:`GCS DroneCAN Interface <dronecan-uavcan-"
"slcan>` or :ref:`DroneCAN GUI <common-uavcan-gui>`."
msgstr ""
"通过 :ref:`GCS DroneCAN 界面 <dronecan-uavcan-slcan>` 或 :ref:`DroneCAN GUI "
"<common-uavcan-gui>` 查看标签的 DroneCAN 参数，即可轻松访问 Battery Tag 数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powermodule-landingpage.rst:65
#: 5493892a62924e13b8ebb3e3f4419adc 94b3447bf48047debd9d4a794cf0d315
#: b0bc34fc411542cd9cbfbb8454af300a e4438fa2455e4456b2591e9c09a41047
msgid ""
"A `Scripting applet "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/BatteryTag.lua>`__"
" can also be used."
msgstr ""
"也可以使用 `脚本小程序 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/BatteryTag.lua>`__。"
